


NEWALIASES(1)       UNIX Programmer's Manual        NEWALIASES(1)



NAME
     newaliases - rebuild the data base for the mail aliases file

SYNOPSIS
     newaliases

DESCRIPTION
     _N_e_w_a_l_i_a_s_e_s rebuilds the random access data base for the mail
     aliases file /_u_s_r/_l_i_b/_a_l_i_a_s_e_s.  It must be run each time
     /_u_s_r/_l_i_b/_a_l_i_a_s_e_s is changed in order for the change to take
     effect.

SEE ALSO
     aliases(5), sendmail(8)









































